# Email MCP Server

Gmail Email MCP Server - Phase 1 Implementation

See [README.md](./README.md) for full documentation.

## Quick Start

```bash
npm install
npm run oauth-bootstrap
npm run daemon
```

## Structure

- `src/` - Source code (secrets, gmail, inbound, outbound, tools, utils)
- `tests/` - Unit tests
- `scripts/` - CLI utilities (oauth-bootstrap)
- `README.md` - Full documentation
